  "releaseProvenance": "Fresh 12 October captures from the native Synth 0.1.5 image (MAIN OS 37661aee..., Modwerk's export-composition-proofs.py, author source 48b89e7: the 2.12 engine, page and chooser and the 2.13 quantizer). The plan is 0.1.4's up to AMP SETUP, then SCALE MINOR, ROOT A and GLIDE in CONTROL > SEQUENCER, SELECT MACHINE TYPE, and a MIDI track: the NOTE page (C3, one NOTE click up to D3) and CHROMATIC (FUNC held, DOWN) with the readout A 3. Seven of the twelve captures are committed (a module carries at most eight media, one of them the audio preview); SRC SETUP, the FM page, the LFO page, LFO SETUP and AMP SETUP are byte-identical to 0.1.4's captures of the same plan on image 00fa6caa; SELECT MACHINE TYPE, also byte-identical to 0.1.4's, the SCALE and ROOT rows, the NOTE page and a key press are kept local.",
